      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00128",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“我听见他们说话了，多难得啊！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I heard them speaking; how rare and precious that was!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00128",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "神佛都没舍弃我，太不敢当了，不是吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Even the gods and Buddhas have not abandoned me; it is more than I deserve, isn't it?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p00128",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "这是心满意足的声音。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It was the voice of someone completely content.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
